@startuml
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

:User:
:Student:
:System:
:Database:

package "App" {
User --> (Login)
User --> (Signup)
(Signup) ..> (Create Username): <<include>>
(Signup) ..> (Create Password): <<include>>

(Re-enter Username) ..> (Create Username): <<extend>>[Username Invalid]
(Re-enter Password) ..> (Create Password): <<extend>>[Password Invalid]

(Re-enter Username) ..> (Login): <<extend>>[Username Invalid]
(Re-enter Password) ..> (Login): <<extend>>[Password Invalid]

(Account Created) ..> (Signup):<<extend>>[User and Pass Valid]
(Account Created) --> Database
(Account Created) ..>(Login): <<include>> 
note left of (Account Created):"User becomes Student"



Student --> (View Previously Completed Courses)
(Unviewable) ..> (View Previously Complete Courses): <<extend>>[Course Incomplete]

Student --> (View GPA)
Student --> (Update Letter Grade)
(Cannot Update Grade) ..> (Update Letter Grade): <<extend>>[Course Invalid]
note right of (Cannot Update Grade): "Course Missing/Not on Roster"
Student --> (Delete Course)
(Cannot Delete Course) ..> (Delete Course): <<extend>>[Course Incomplete]
note left of (Cannot Delete Course): "Course Incomplete or Missing"



System --> (Display all Previous Courses)
System --> (Calculate GPA)
System --> (Display GPA)

}
@endum1

